@startuml
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
actor Operator
component "React / nginx" as UI
component "Java backend replicas\nOne fenced coordinator" as Backend
component "Python inventory\nStock and reservations in RAM" as Inventory
database PostgreSQL as DB
database Redis as Cache
queue "RabbitMQ / MQTT" as MQTT
queue Kafka
node "Machine StatefulSets\n1 Pod per physical machine" {
  component "C controller\nRAM state / local STOP / flush" as Machine
}
Operator --> UI
Operator --> Machine : local socket adapter
UI --> Backend : HTTP / WebSocket
Backend --> DB : orders / ownership / outbox
Backend --> Cache : live machine registry / heartbeat TTL
Backend --> Inventory : HTTP JSON reservations
Backend <--> MQTT : commands / critical events / ACK
MQTT <--> Machine
Machine --> Kafka : synthetic telemetry
Backend <--> Kafka : telemetry / canonical batch events
@enduml
